workers/repository/process/lookup/filter-checks.js:47-70 (paraphrase of the read source):
  a candidate release with a releaseTimestamp younger than minimumReleaseAge is skipped
  as pending; a candidate WITHOUT a releaseTimestamp is skipped only under
  timestamp-required; under the default timestamp-optional it PASSES with a once-warn log.
util/package-rules/index.js:28: `for (const packageRule of packageRules)`: rules are
  applied in array order and each matching rule's values override the previous
  (mergeChildConfig), so a later automerge:false wins over an earlier automerge:true.
config/options/index.js:2904: platformAutomerge default true (GitHub auto-merge, which
  waits on required checks; this is what makes "gated on green required checks" the
  accurate phrase).
workers/repository/update/branch/execute-post-upgrade-commands.js:95-96: the exec result
  of a postUpgradeTask is passed to logger.debug only; :99-103: a FAILING command's stderr
  is pushed to artifactErrors (which render in the PR as an artifact-update problem).
  No path carries a succeeding command's stdout into the PR body.
modules/manager/custom/regex/utils.js:16: 'registryUrl' is a supported capture field
  (packed into dependency.registryUrls after URL validation).

